    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> are any <math><mn>4</mn></math> points in space. If <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is the area of triangle <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to",
