    "text": "Let, the position vectors are&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced>